      "content": "it works but it feels a bit cliché. can you make the senator's part more detailed? i want him to lay out a really complex, airtight argument about why the surveillance is actually a moral necessity for protecting people. and for the activist, maybe make her points feel a bit more like she's just lashing out instead of having a coherent counter-argument.",
